{"4382260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Castaway Diary: Portal to the Unknown Isles", "steam_appid": 4382260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/f5dbd8070609cb73be5ef64a38c33b49.avif?t=1776126468\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a mysterious, unknown island, a young girl must learn to navigate an unfamiliar world. But life here is far from dark or gloomy! Fueled by positivity and bright spirits, these girls refuse to give up, always looking forward to a better tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to enjoy the island’s freedom solo or team up with others to overcome challenges, a heartwarming and vibrant adventure awaits. Hold onto the hope of returning home and begin your journey today!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/70de14c2f0c9b13255b7362b196a2e89.avif?t=1776126468\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/a993004d3abec865f781e0cfe262beac.poster.avif?t=1776126468\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/a993004d3abec865f781e0cfe262beac.webm?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/a993004d3abec865f781e0cfe262beac.mp4?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From gathering and fishing to cooking and tailoring—use the island’s natural resources to craft essentials and enjoy a bountiful lifestyle. With a reliable mount by your side, you can roam every corner of the vast island with ease.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/d5e2aeb70c93937b66902c45b1b6ef73.avif?t=1776126468\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/1ecc9627897eb6d8647748ada6c2e0c2.poster.avif?t=1776126468\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/1ecc9627897eb6d8647748ada6c2e0c2.webm?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/1ecc9627897eb6d8647748ada6c2e0c2.mp4?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new lands and venture into mysterious dungeons hidden across the archipelago. Experience the thrill of the hunt as you take on a variety of adorable monsters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/5fe6ef2390fb576ece02f36d81ca78e4.avif?t=1776126468\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/fe72d2898431a4a79166f6b40a5440d5.poster.avif?t=1776126468\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/fe72d2898431a4a79166f6b40a5440d5.webm?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/fe72d2898431a4a79166f6b40a5440d5.mp4?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond simple survival and create a space that is uniquely yours. Decorate your home inside and out, tend to a flourishing farm, and fully embrace the peaceful rhythm of island life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/17509408ef2a3c6a7f9f95768cdccf3b.avif?t=1776126468\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/0177bb93747d42ad7b229776446ab1dd.poster.avif?t=1776126468\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/0177bb93747d42ad7b229776446ab1dd.webm?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/0177bb93747d42ad7b229776446ab1dd.mp4?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a wide array of stunning and vibrant costumes. While the girls are already charming, your personal touch and fashion sense will make your character truly shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/c9f780d725b4e25e2020fea5a88652b6.avif?t=1776126468\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/961087b72ed923f0e852bf92573b5c34.poster.avif?t=1776126468\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/961087b72ed923f0e852bf92573b5c34.webm?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/961087b72ed923f0e852bf92573b5c34.mp4?t=1776126468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet solo getaway is wonderful, but the joy is doubled when shared with friends! Build houses together, conquer challenging dungeons, and create unforgettable memories as a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your very own special island adventure with the girls right now!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/f5dbd8070609cb73be5ef64a38c33b49.avif?t=1776126468\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a mysterious, unknown island, a young girl must learn to navigate an unfamiliar world. But life here is far from dark or gloomy! Fueled by positivity and bright spirits, these girls refuse to give up, always looking forward to a better tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to enjoy the island’s freedom solo or team up with others to overcome challenges, a heartwarming and vibrant adventure awaits. Hold onto the hope of returning home and begin your journey today!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/70de14c2f0c9b13255b7362b196a2e89.avif?t=1776126468\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382260/extras/a993004d3abec865f781e0cfe262beac.poster.avif